{"version":1,"content":"<p>伯克希爾·哈撒韋自2026年初新任行政總裁格雷格·阿貝爾上任以來，已停止出售蘋果股票。目前，蘋果在該公司股票投資組合中所佔比例達到25%，成為其最重要的持倉之一。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587668.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T13:34:53.819503+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T13:24:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:28:17.957113+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T13:28:17.957113+00:00","content_hash":"7c048dd71185af36168a53364dbbb0194883d1f0c87dd42f16f151164728c678","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}